stream
BT
/F2 13 Tf 54 735 Td 17 TL
(6  Recovering the ManyDoseConcentration Function) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 0 -22 Td 12 TL
(For finitely many doses the notebooks evaluate Form A, [9], using ceilings to) Tj T*
(identify the current cycle. With P=24, set) Tj
/F3 9 Tf 45 -17 Td
(n = ceil[t/24],       m = ceil[[t-x]/24].                          [20]) Tj
/F1 9 Tf -45 -20 Td 12 TL
(Thus n counts doses administered and m counts those that have finished absorbing.) Tj
/F2 9 Tf 0 -18 Td
(Theorem 6.2 - Complete finite-n profile) Tj
/F3 7.7 Tf 0 -17 Td 10.5 TL
(For 0 < t <= x:) Tj T*
(  C[t;x,h] = [[12+t-12n] n]/x.) Tj T*
(For t > x:) Tj T*
(  C[t;x,h] = 2^[[x-t]/h] [2^[24m/h]-1]/[2^[24/h]-1] [n-m]) Tj T*
(             - [-12-t+12n+12m]/x.                                [21]) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 0 -22 Td 12 TL
(The first bracket of the lower branch is Form A with nP replaced by 24m: the finite) Tj T*
(geometric series summing tails of the m doses that have completed absorption. The) Tj T*
(second bracket is the absorption-ramp correction and vanishes whenever n=m.) Tj T*
(Letting m -> infinity with tau fixed returns [13].) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 0 -30 Td
(7  Summary and Conclusion) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 0 -22 Td 12 TL
(The derivation reduces to one observation: a sum of exponential tails offset by equal) Tj T*
(time steps is a geometric series. Anchoring the sum at the most recent dose makes the) Tj T*
(closed form, its limit, and both clinical extremes follow in a few lines of algebra.) Tj T*
(The base-two convention makes half-life visible at every stage. The finite-n ceiling) Tj T*
(form is Form A of the same series with the current cycle identified by [20].) Tj
/F3 8 Tf 0 -20 Td 10.5 TL
(Step 1: c' = k1 c -> c[t] = k2 2^[-t/h].) Tj T*
(Step 2: ramp t/x on [0,x], then 2^[-[t-x]/h].) Tj T*
(Step 3: C_n[tau] = 2^[-tau/h] [1-r^n]/[1-r], r=2^[-P/h].) Tj T*
(Step 4: C_inf[tau] = 2^[-tau/h]/[1-2^[-P/h]].) Tj T*
(Step 5: peak, trough, and fluctuation follow from the endpoints.) Tj T*
(Step 6: finite-n form is ManyDoseConcentration, with the cycle ceilings.) Tj
/F1 8 Tf 190 -45 Td
(Page 7 of 8) Tj
ET
endstream
